ize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="69" width="440" height="96" /></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="16 · AI conversation, memory and shared-Reel entities" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;align=left;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="17" width="2425.968" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="Implemented entities and conceptual associations; database enforcement is stated in the constraint note." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;align=left;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="65" width="2425.968" height="65" /></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="UML entity model: solid lines are associations; multiplicities describe the named roles, not database integrity. Attributes use [0..1] for optional values and [0..*] for lists. {PK}/{UQ} are schema-key constraints. Enforced relations and scalar-ID mappings are listed below; cross-service IDs are not foreign keys.&lt;br&gt;Solid Mongo associations are ORM relations, not SQL foreign-key constraints. ConversationMember is a parallel membership projection; participantIds remains a canonical contract. User IDs refer to User Service. No RagTrace entity exists in the current local AI schema; Langfuse holds monitoring snapshots.&lt;br&gt;conversation: conversationId: Prisma Mongo association (declared Mongo ORM relation, not SQL FK); conversation: conversationId: Prisma Mongo association (declared Mongo ORM relation, not SQL FK); summary context: conversationId UNIQUE: logical one summary per conversation (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); source&lt;br&gt;conversation: optional sourceConversationId (logical provenance) (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); share context: conversationId: cross-service share context (scalar-ID association; no declared FK); linked message: messageId: optional until Reel message linked (scalar-ID association; no declared FK)" vertex="1" parent="1" style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#fff8ed;strokeColor=#687782;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="1149.976" width="2425.968" height="108" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="17-auth-register" name="17 · Registration and account verification"><mxGraphModel page="0" pageWidth="1955" pageHeight="2123" grid="1" gridSize="10" adaptiveColors="auto" semanticModel="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;17-auth-register&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;17 \u00b7 Registration and account verification&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Successful registration followed by an optional later code submission; confirmation reads then deletes the code.&quot;,&quot;participants&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mobile&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Velora-Mobile&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;client&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;mobile:src/api/auth.api.ts:56-131&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;gateway&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;API Gateway&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/api-gateway/src/auth/auth.controller.ts:67-180&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;auth&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Auth service&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/src/application/use-cases/login.use-case.ts:18-80&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;User service&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/src/infrastructure/adapters/user-service.adapter.ts:25-135&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;db&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Auth private database&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;store&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/src/infrastructure/rep