awaiting a correlated RabbitMQ response; transport envelopes are abstracted.&lt;br&gt;Content controller attaches JwtAuthGuard, not global RolesGuard (content.controller.ts:68-71). Public/friends/private policy is invoked only for nonowner nonadmin.&lt;br&gt;Missing metadata exits before friend access or episode listing; ref preserves this subordinate failure." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#12263a;fillColor=#ffffff;;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="28" y="2865" width="2164" height="102" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="22-auth-logout" name="22 · Logout versus in-flight refresh"><mxGraphModel page="0" pageWidth="1690" pageHeight="2140" grid="1" gridSize="10" adaptiveColors="auto" semanticModel="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;22-auth-logout&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;22 \u00b7 Logout versus in-flight refresh&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Logout fence waits for in-flight refresh; local clear follows remote success; endLogout always runs.&quot;,&quot;participants&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mobile&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Velora-Mobile&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;client&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;mobile:src/api/auth.api.ts:56-131&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;secure&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Mobile SecureStore&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;store&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;mobile:src/lib/auth/tokenSession.ts:7-52&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;gateway&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;API Gateway&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/api-gateway/src/auth/auth.controller.ts:67-180&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;auth&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Auth service&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/src/application/use-cases/login.use-case.ts:18-80&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;db&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Auth