e the caller path into the failure-handler ref; optional visual skip still sets readiness. NO_AUDIO sends no ASR RPC and creates no ASR segments.&lt;br&gt;Token gate counts/reversions precede reusable DRAFT embedding lookup and generation. Adaptive section boundary embeddings, if configured, are a different earlier operation.&lt;br&gt;Logical awaited RabbitMQ RPC abstracts transport envelopes. Source model only; native layout/render/visual acceptance belongs to parent." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#12263a;fillColor=#ffffff;;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="28" y="6217" width="1899" height="138" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="30-index-resume" name="30 · Same-attempt resume and stale delivery"><mxGraphModel page="0" pageWidth="1690" pageHeight="5569" grid="1" gridSize="10" adaptiveColors="auto" semanticModel="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;30-index-resume&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;30 \u00b7 Same-attempt resume and stale delivery&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Same-attempt domain reuse; versioned graph checkpoints; explicit delivery settlement.&quot;,&quot;participants&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;rmq&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;RabbitMQ delivery / retry queues&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;external&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/reel-indexing-service/src/infrastructure/controllers/reel-indexing.controller.ts:22-65&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Reel Indexing Service&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/reel-indexing-service/src/infrastructure/workflows/reel-index-langgraph.workflow.ts:492-504&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;db&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Index checkpoints / semantic DB&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;store&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/reel-indexing-service/src/infrastructure/repositories/prisma-i