. Fragments use source predicates; ref expands a subordinate interaction.&lt;br&gt;This is not a guarantee against every stale response: saveReels returns void and the reader can still use its already-read snapshot.&lt;br&gt;The pictured alt is scoped to an existing tombstone. For non-tombstone values, currentVersion &amp;gt; incomingVersion also rejects.&lt;br&gt;Invalidation failure retains local quarantine; successful newer fill clears it." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#12263a;fillColor=#ffffff;;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="28" y="1742" width="1104" height="102" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="34-hls-streaming" name="34 · HLS streaming and asset prefetch"><mxGraphModel page="0" pageWidth="1425" pageHeight="4240" grid="1" gridSize="10" adaptiveColors="auto" semanticModel="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;34-hls-streaming&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;34 \u00b7 HLS streaming and asset prefetch&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Independent player, asset warmup, and policy-gated full-copy activity.&quot;,&quot;participants&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;viewer&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Mobile Reel viewer&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;client&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;mobile:src/components/reels/ReelsViewer.tsx:985-1025&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;player&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ReelVideo / native player&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;client&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;mobile:src/components/reels/ReelVideo.tsx:177-193&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;warm&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Asset warmup worker&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;mobile:src/lib/reel-prefetch.ts:143-183&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;offline&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Offline cache worker + local storage&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;mobile:src/lib/offlineReelVide