te interaction.&lt;br&gt;Conversation persistence remains Conversation-owned; the ref excludes ordinary conversation, calls, payments and notifications.&lt;br&gt;A Reel message does not trigger AI; a subsequent text question uses stored shared-Reel context.&lt;br&gt;Socket event emission precedes create_message RPC return; client reception/reconciliation need not complete before that return." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#12263a;fillColor=#ffffff;;fontFamily=Arial;"><mxGeometry x="28" y="4345" width="2164" height="102" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="38-sharing-public-link" name="38 · External link and access lifecycle"><mxGraphModel page="0" pageWidth="1690" pageHeight="4301" grid="1" gridSize="10" adaptiveColors="auto" semanticModel="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;38-sharing-public-link&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;38 \u00b7 External link and access lifecycle&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Independent create/revoke/resolve operations with creator and recipient separated.&quot;,&quot;participants&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;creator&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Link creator / owner caller&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;client&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/api-gateway/src/content/content.controller.ts:689-731&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;recipient&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Public link recipient&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;client&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/api-gateway/src/content/public-reel-share.controller.ts:48-86&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;gateway&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;API Gateway / public resolver&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/api-gateway/src/content/public-reel-share.controller.ts:48-86&quot;]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;content&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Content Service&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;e